1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Seventh Episode
The Swan
Slow Swan

15
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:10,479
Hey-!

16
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:10,539
Huh?

17
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,540
Garigori!

18
00:02:15,005 --> 00:02:17,180
Yahoo!

19
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,280
Garigori!

20
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,580
It seems it's time!

21
00:02:27,810 --> 00:02:29,500
What happened, Garigori?

22
00:02:30,510 --> 00:02:33,760
My daughter Mari has vanished.

23
00:02:33,950 --> 00:02:34,680
What should I do?

24
00:02:34,834 --> 00:02:35,940
Mari?

25
00:02:36,390 --> 00:02:37,920
Where are you, Mari?!

26
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:49,078
Wishing you a very Happy Birthday, Lady Hecate.

27
00:03:58,341 --> 00:04:02,105
Happy Birthday to you,

28
00:04:02,129 --> 00:04:07,297
Happy Birthday dear Hecate,

29
00:04:07,321 --> 00:04:10,680
Happy Birthday to you.

30
00:04:10,704 --> 00:04:12,114
Thank you, everyone.

31
00:04:13,018 --> 00:04:14,440
 I assume you all brought presents...

32
00:04:14,441 --> 00:04:15,006
Right?

33
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:33,820
Is that a lotion made by mixing goblin blood with poisonous lizard blood?

34
00:04:33,995 --> 00:04:35,160
Indeed. Lady Hecate....

35
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:39,960
If you apply it morning and night, it will make you ever so cruel and cunning.

36
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:45,600
Hmph, eye drops filled with the rotten tears of a vulture inside the horn of a one-eyed goat?

37
00:04:45,850 --> 00:04:51,060
Ah, just as you foresaw. May it grant you the power to see in the dark and see through the human heart.

38
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,100
Nonsense!

39
00:04:52,185 --> 00:04:53,460
You clueless demons!

40
00:04:57,760 --> 00:05:00,080
There is only one thing I want for Hecate.

41
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:02,200
Can you fools not even foresee that?

42
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,780
I want to put a heart into that chest!

43
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:07,561
Prince Sapphire... That's it!

44
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,600
Prince Sapphire has a boy's heart in the body of a girl.

45
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:16,040
If I take that boy's heart and put it into Hecate, she will be reborn as a great witch, just as I desire!

46
00:05:16,375 --> 00:05:17,375
That swan!

47
00:05:28,130 --> 00:05:30,720
We'll use this swan to lure Sapphire!

48
00:05:30,980 --> 00:05:31,340
Go!

49
00:05:31,735 --> 00:05:32,940
Cursed swan!

50
00:05:47,755 --> 00:05:49,000
Mari?

51
00:05:50,140 --> 00:05:52,260
Where did you go?

52
00:05:52,419 --> 00:05:53,960
Honestly...

53
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,022
Mari...

54
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:07,120
What is it?

55
00:06:07,289 --> 00:06:08,289
Did you find Mari?

56
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,993
Not yet, Your Highness.

57
00:06:10,650 --> 00:06:12,400
All right, keep looking everywhere!

58
00:06:12,401 --> 00:06:13,401
Yes, sir!

59
00:06:30,610 --> 00:06:32,400
It's a swan...

60
00:06:37,810 --> 00:06:39,620
Poor thing, it's injured...

61
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,420
You don't have to run away!

62
00:06:52,099 --> 00:06:53,660
Hey, Garigori!

63
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:55,339
Catch that swan!

64
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,926
I don't have time to worry about swans!

65
00:07:00,710 --> 00:07:01,919
But Garigori...

66
00:07:06,815 --> 00:07:09,540
If it flies, its injuries will only get worse...

67
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,113
There's the swan!

68
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:38,414
No, don't thrash around like that...

69
00:07:38,705 --> 00:07:40,027
Sapphire!

70
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:41,666
Hey!

71
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,720
Over here!

72
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:44,460
Ah, Tink!

73
00:07:45,950 --> 00:07:47,300
What's wrong with that swan?

74
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:48,870
It's injured!

75
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:49,840
She needs a doctor!

76
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:51,280
It's a demon!

77
00:07:51,340 --> 00:07:52,340
A demon?

78
00:07:52,370 --> 00:07:53,460
I can smell it!

79
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,680
This swan has been put under a demon's curse!

80
00:07:57,780 --> 00:08:01,140
Angel feathers have the power to lift a demon's curse!

81
00:08:02,195 --> 00:08:03,920
See? Doesn't that feel better?

82
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,140
You're not a bird?

83
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,300
You're saying you're not a bird?

84
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,780
A human girl?

85
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:17,880
What did you say?

86
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:19,070
You're human?

87
00:08:20,900 --> 00:08:25,240
I was kidnapped by Mephisto the demon, and transformed into this shape by magic.

88
00:08:25,659 --> 00:08:27,180
What's your name?

89
00:08:28,620 --> 00:08:29,360
She says her name is Mari!

90
00:08:29,565 --> 00:08:31,400
Mari was turned into something like this?!

91
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:32,620
Man, what a shock!

92
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:34,600
We'd better go tell Mr. Garigori!

93
00:08:34,650 --> 00:08:35,840
Mari!

94
00:08:36,479 --> 00:08:37,659
Mari!

95
00:08:39,339 --> 00:08:42,700
Papa is about to go out of his mind!

96
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,560
Mari!

97
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,519
Mari!

98
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,340
Garigori!

99
00:08:49,425 --> 00:08:50,740
We found Mari!

100
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
W-Where?

101
00:08:53,199 --> 00:08:54,200
It's this swan!

102
00:08:54,355 --> 00:08:56,500
A demon's magic turned her into this!

103
00:08:59,699 --> 00:09:00,699
Mari!

104
00:09:01,869 --> 00:09:03,420
In a state like this!

105
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:05,460
Poor Mari!

106
00:09:05,985 --> 00:09:08,040
Please say something!

107
00:09:08,405 --> 00:09:09,540
Mari!

108
00:09:09,845 --> 00:09:11,600
My Mari!

109
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:13,980
Mari!

110
00:09:24,129 --> 00:09:25,182
All right!

111
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:26,281
Opal!

112
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:26,920
Opal!

113
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:27,440
No!

114
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:28,080
Let go of me!

115
00:09:28,285 --> 00:09:29,380
I'm going to defeat the demon!

116
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:29,810
No!

117
00:09:29,835 --> 00:09:31,280
This is the demon's trap!

118
00:09:31,365 --> 00:09:32,000
Mari!

119
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:32,720
Mari!

120
00:09:33,059 --> 00:09:34,260
Pull yourself together!

121
00:09:34,261 --> 00:09:34,780
Opal!

122
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,280
Opal!

123
00:09:38,741 --> 00:09:39,960
That's why I'm begging you!

124
00:09:39,965 --> 00:09:40,965
Opal!

125
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:42,800
Go!

126
00:09:42,900 --> 00:09:43,439
Opal!

127
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,006
Your destination is the Black Ghost Island!

128
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:50,486
Hey!

129
00:09:50,540 --> 00:09:51,280
Not that way!

130
00:09:51,425 --> 00:09:52,140
Over there!

131
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:52,659
Opal!

132
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,080
Look!

133
00:09:53,569 --> 00:09:54,700
I told you to stop!

134
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:55,760
Opal!

135
00:09:55,940 --> 00:09:56,940
Opal!

136
00:10:09,955 --> 00:10:11,000
What's going on?

137
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:12,640
I'm sorry.

138
00:10:12,890 --> 00:10:16,520
Because if Sapphire gets caught by the demon, it's all over!

139
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:17,653
Don't be stupid!

140
00:10:17,895 --> 00:10:19,459
I won't allow you to tie up the Prince!

141
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:23,760
I'm going to go drive the demon away, so wait in this church until I get back, okay?

142
00:10:24,445 --> 00:10:26,380
demons can't enter a church...

143
00:10:26,381 --> 00:10:27,420
No, you can't!

144
00:10:27,475 --> 00:10:29,300
You can't do that, Tink!

145
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:30,390
Yes I can!

146
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,340
Because I have angel wings!

147
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:33,360
Tink!

148
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:34,420
Wait!

149
00:10:36,309 --> 00:10:38,220
Mari is dead.

150
00:10:41,119 --> 00:10:43,360
She's already growing cold...

151
00:10:46,479 --> 00:10:47,560
No...

152
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:48,940
Tink!

153
00:10:49,815 --> 00:10:51,353
There's still hope.

154
00:10:51,739 --> 00:10:54,740
The demon's magical orb absorbed Mari's heart.

155
00:10:55,199 --> 00:10:57,740
We just need to expose that orb to the morning sun and destroy it.

156
00:10:58,260 --> 00:10:58,920
Let go of me!

157
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:00,493
I'm going to get that orb!

158
00:11:01,153 --> 00:11:01,473
Hey!

159
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,055
Wait!

160
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,080
Tink!

161
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:15,156
H...Highness!

162
00:11:21,192 --> 00:11:21,840
Opal!

163
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:26,740
And... hup!

164
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:27,420
And... hup!

165
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,120
Hurry!

166
00:11:28,300 --> 00:11:28,740
Hurry!

167
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:29,320
Hurry!

168
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:30,580
And... hup!

169
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,886
No! No! I said no!

170
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,340
Opal! Stop!

171
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:40,820
You're in the way! Opal!

172
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,100
I won't let you find it!

173
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:43,280
Get off!

174
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:43,913
Let go!

175
00:11:44,502 --> 00:11:45,502
Sapphire!

176
00:11:48,199 --> 00:11:51,220
What kind of royal house of Silverland are we if we're scared of a demon or two?!

177
00:11:51,706 --> 00:11:52,346
All right!

178
00:11:52,700 --> 00:11:53,700
I'm borrowing this!

179
00:11:53,724 --> 00:11:55,336
Bad! Bad! Bad! Bad!

180
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:57,980
If you get caught by the demon this time, it's over!

181
00:11:58,290 --> 00:12:01,880
What will happen to Silverland if Sapphire gets taken down?!

182
00:12:09,385 --> 00:12:10,385
This is fine.

183
00:12:10,835 --> 00:12:13,020
Now all that's left is to wait for Sapphire to arrive.

184
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:14,680
Come on, Hecate!

185
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:15,920
Let's dance with Papa!

186
00:12:16,770 --> 00:12:19,473
I feel kind of sick...

187
00:12:19,498 --> 00:12:20,660
Feel sick?

188
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:21,460
Well, that won't do.

189
00:12:21,655 --> 00:12:22,700
How about drinking some poison?

190
00:12:23,199 --> 00:12:25,856
Or maybe... That's it...

191
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:26,499
Hey!

192
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,600
You demons!

193
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:31,700
What's this, everyone's gotten drunk.

194
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,686
Dance!

195
00:12:57,139 --> 00:12:58,280
Sapphire, that's unfair!

196
00:12:58,410 --> 00:12:59,960
Untie me!

197
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:04,660
Just wait!

198
00:13:05,139 --> 00:13:07,280
I'll vanquish you right now!

199
00:14:10,839 --> 00:14:12,126
Hecate, come here!

200
00:14:17,259 --> 00:14:18,820
Look, she's feeling better now.

201
00:14:20,159 --> 00:14:23,120
Are you mentally prepared to become a great witch, Hecate?

202
00:14:23,289 --> 00:14:25,000
Papa, I'm scared.

203
00:14:25,073 --> 00:14:27,240
It's okay, Papa is right here with you.

204
00:14:27,575 --> 00:14:31,360
You know, for your sake, Papa is willing to fight against Heaven itself.

205
00:14:31,625 --> 00:14:36,360
But... but if you do that, Papa, you'll be punished and turned back into dirt.

206
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,800
I don't care if I'm turned into a lump of dirt.

207
00:14:39,139 --> 00:14:40,560
If it's for my sweet girl.

208
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:42,720
Papa...

209
00:15:03,135 --> 00:15:06,580
Was that fun, Hecate?

210
00:15:07,486 --> 00:15:10,200
Yes, it's been a while, so it was fun, Papa.

211
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:11,940
Decoroasha!

212
00:15:15,519 --> 00:15:17,291
It's something nice, open it up and see.

213
00:15:17,315 --> 00:15:18,640
I wonder what it could be...

214
00:15:21,909 --> 00:15:24,300
Happy Birthday to You!

215
00:15:24,609 --> 00:15:26,840
Happy Birthday to You!

216
00:15:27,479 --> 00:15:29,006
Hey, happy birthday.

217
00:15:29,275 --> 00:15:31,820
Now then, how old is Hecate turning again?

218
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:32,820
13.

219
00:15:33,105 --> 00:15:34,105
You demons!

220
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:36,013
That means 13 candles!

221
00:15:38,979 --> 00:15:41,146
Wow, that's wonderful, Papa.

222
00:15:41,519 --> 00:15:43,526
Come on, Hecate, blow out the candles.

223
00:15:45,139 --> 00:15:48,518
Whoa, hold on! Why don't you use magic to blow them out?

224
00:15:48,543 --> 00:15:49,483
Mattara!

225
00:15:52,214 --> 00:15:55,086
If a gust of wind won't put it out, what's next?

226
00:15:55,595 --> 00:15:56,740
Allerugease!

227
00:15:57,199 --> 00:15:59,060
Low-flying birds, consume the fire!

228
00:16:01,845 --> 00:16:03,240
Hot hot hot hot hot!

229
00:16:03,264 --> 00:16:04,264
Ah, no good, no good.

230
00:16:04,410 --> 00:16:05,500
Any other way?

231
00:16:06,185 --> 00:16:07,185
Ame yo!
- O Rain!

232
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,340
So close!

233
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:11,553
Make it rain a bit harder!

234
00:16:11,665 --> 00:16:12,939
Oame yo!
- O Heavy rain!

235
00:16:14,225 --> 00:16:17,460
Ah, no good. Our cake is going to get ruined!

236
00:16:18,025 --> 00:16:19,320
I'm hopeless, aren't I?

237
00:16:19,355 --> 00:16:21,940
No, you're getting warm.

238
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:24,140
It's fine, it's fine, just leave me alone.

239
00:16:24,285 --> 00:16:27,263
I'm not the kind of kid who could ever become a demon like Papa anyway.

240
00:16:27,287 --> 00:16:31,760
You shouldn't sulk like that so easily. You need to act more like a witch—be bold and brazen.

241
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:38,764
Lord Demon King, I smell a human.

242
00:16:38,788 --> 00:16:39,595
What?

243
00:16:39,620 --> 00:16:42,486
Have they arrived? Hmm, I see, I do smell it.

244
00:16:42,735 --> 00:16:44,980
So you've finally come, Sapphire.

245
00:16:46,689 --> 00:16:48,340
Hecate, get ready.

246
00:16:58,332 --> 00:17:00,302
Now, I won't let you escape, Sapphire.

247
00:17:00,326 --> 00:17:02,553
 Why, why did you come, Sapphire?

248
00:17:03,039 --> 00:17:06,740
No! I don't want your boy's heart!

249
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,960
What are you saying, Hecate?

250
00:17:07,984 --> 00:17:11,718
Papa, no, no! I want to stay just as I am!

251
00:17:11,742 --> 00:17:13,940
You fool, what good will being so faint-hearted do?!

252
00:17:14,339 --> 00:17:16,040
Hurry up and lie down on the magic bed.

253
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,260
It will be over in no time.

254
00:17:18,059 --> 00:17:20,300
Come out, Sapphire Prince of Silverland!

255
00:17:28,380 --> 00:17:29,380
Behind you!

256
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:33,440
It's those strange wings!

257
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:40,800
Hecate!

258
00:17:46,609 --> 00:17:48,100
I'll be taking the magic orb!

259
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,640
Hand that over.

260
00:17:51,909 --> 00:17:53,120
As if I'd give it to you!

261
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,480
Hecate!

262
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,480
Damn it!

263
00:18:01,940 --> 00:18:02,940
What are you doing?!

264
00:18:03,299 --> 00:18:06,340
If you lay a finger on Hecate, I, the Demon King, won't let you off easy!

265
00:18:06,429 --> 00:18:08,200
Demon King, hand over the magic orb.

266
00:18:08,479 --> 00:18:09,920
Then I'll give Hecate back.

267
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:11,060
What?!

268
00:18:16,329 --> 00:18:17,520
Damn that feather!

269
00:18:17,989 --> 00:18:19,180
It's a swap for Hecate.

270
00:18:19,379 --> 00:18:20,223
Hand over the orb!

271
00:18:20,248 --> 00:18:22,020
What a cowardly trade!

272
00:18:22,659 --> 00:18:24,206
And you call yourself a prince?!

273
00:18:24,580 --> 00:18:25,580
What are you talking about?

274
00:18:25,819 --> 00:18:29,580
Look who's talking—you're the one who turned poor Garigori's precious Mari into a swan!

275
00:18:30,134 --> 00:18:31,600
Now, Demon King, answer me.

276
00:18:32,194 --> 00:18:33,260
Is it yes or no?

277
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:36,161
Alright, take this. Here.

278
00:18:55,726 --> 00:18:57,913
Hurry, I said hurry up.

279
00:19:17,059 --> 00:19:19,160
Hurry, hurry it up.

280
00:19:24,059 --> 00:19:24,902
Thank you.

281
00:19:27,366 --> 00:19:28,081
Wait.

282
00:19:31,064 --> 00:19:33,100
No, I called the bird.

283
00:19:33,909 --> 00:19:36,246
How can I help?

284
00:19:36,509 --> 00:19:39,493
Because I can hold onto insects and fly.

285
00:19:39,614 --> 00:19:40,614
Please try it.

286
00:19:41,520 --> 00:19:43,300
I am so exhausted.

287
00:20:26,569 --> 00:20:27,569
It's sticking out!

288
00:20:27,925 --> 00:20:28,860
Look at that feather...

289
00:20:29,129 --> 00:20:30,601
blow that feather up into the air!

290
00:20:32,679 --> 00:20:34,800
With that, it's as good as ours.

291
00:20:35,039 --> 00:20:35,700
Hecate!

292
00:20:36,020 --> 00:20:37,020
Hecate!

293
00:20:39,119 --> 00:20:40,900
Hecate, where are you!

294
00:20:41,990 --> 00:20:42,990
Shh!

295
00:20:43,219 --> 00:20:44,440
Hide me, okay?

296
00:20:45,414 --> 00:20:47,600
Hakucho ni nare.
- Become a swan.

297
00:20:52,340 --> 00:20:53,340
Hecate!

298
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:54,440
Where is Hecate!

299
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,200
So you hid, did you.

300
00:20:56,859 --> 00:20:58,440
It's no use trying to fool Papa.

301
00:20:58,839 --> 00:21:01,100
Even if you disguise yourself as a swan, Papa can tell easily.

302
00:21:01,869 --> 00:21:03,893
Hecate, don't make trouble for Papa!

303
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:05,200
No!

304
00:21:05,315 --> 00:21:06,315
Nooo!

305
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:06,880
Fool!

306
00:21:07,194 --> 00:21:08,840
If you're a demon's daughter, act like a demon!

307
00:21:09,039 --> 00:21:12,600
So as long as your own child is fine, you don't care how miserable other people become?

308
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:13,660
You stubborn fool!

309
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:16,240
Nooo!

310
00:21:16,389 --> 00:21:17,100
Nooo!

311
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,200
Nooo!

312
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:24,880
Is it morning already?

313
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:27,420
But this is strange. That shouldn't be possible.

314
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:29,440
That's no good.

315
00:21:29,769 --> 00:21:30,769
Do it better.

316
00:21:31,140 --> 00:21:31,640
Yes.

317
00:21:36,715 --> 00:21:39,071
No, that's wrong. It's cock-a-doodle-doo...

318
00:21:39,095 --> 00:21:40,261
 is this still no good?

319
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:44,940
I did it!

320
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:45,960
Morning, you say?

321
00:21:46,120 --> 00:21:46,700
It's too early!

322
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:47,840
It's way too early!

323
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:50,100
Shut up!

324
00:21:50,264 --> 00:21:51,077
Stupid rooster!

325
00:21:51,340 --> 00:21:52,699
Don't summon the morning! Shut up!

326
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:55,166
I said shut up!

327
00:21:57,205 --> 00:21:58,920
Help me!

328
00:22:01,859 --> 00:22:02,900
It's an Angel!

329
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:03,880
It's an Angel!

330
00:22:04,115 --> 00:22:05,580
Help me!

331
00:22:05,900 --> 00:22:06,380
Hecate!

332
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,220
Hecate!

333
00:22:07,504 --> 00:22:08,740
Help me!

334
00:22:09,079 --> 00:22:10,380
Help me!

335
00:22:11,652 --> 00:22:12,045
Hecate!

336
00:22:14,120 --> 00:22:15,120
Papa!

337
00:22:15,330 --> 00:22:16,400
Hand over that orb!

338
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:17,140
Hurry!

339
00:22:17,620 --> 00:22:18,080
Hand it over!

340
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:20,380
As if I'd hand it over!
Get away from me!

341
00:22:24,380 --> 00:22:24,840
Where's the orb?

342
00:22:25,109 --> 00:22:26,240
The orb is in the water!

343
00:22:26,264 --> 00:22:27,264
In the water!

344
00:22:27,300 --> 00:22:27,560
Ah!

345
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:28,880
Sapphire!

346
00:22:29,169 --> 00:22:30,400
Oh, Sapphire... wake up...

347
00:22:36,249 --> 00:22:36,980
Tink!

348
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:37,760
Sapphire!

349
00:22:37,944 --> 00:22:39,400
An orb in the water?!

350
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:40,620
That's right!

351
00:22:48,259 --> 00:22:52,180
If we shine the morning sun on this orb, the swan's spell will be broken, right?

352
00:22:52,780 --> 00:22:53,780
It's morning!

353
00:22:53,889 --> 00:22:55,200
East is over that way!

354
00:23:30,581 --> 00:23:31,581
Mari!

355
00:23:31,849 --> 00:23:33,320
Cute Mari!

356
00:23:33,460 --> 00:23:34,840
My Mari!

357
00:23:34,860 --> 00:23:35,980
Papa!

358
00:23:50,699 --> 00:23:53,060
There's another swan over there!

359
00:23:53,379 --> 00:23:55,320
That's the demon's daughter!

360
00:23:56,239 --> 00:23:57,680
I wonder why she followed us?

361
00:23:58,149 --> 00:23:59,920
I'm sure she just wants to be friends!

